	"pnpm": {
		"comment": "Overrides pin vulnerable transitive (mostly build-time) deps to patched versions. Scoped per major so a fix never forces a cross-major jump that would break a consumer's module shape (e.g. eslintrc's default-import of minimatch@3).",
